t. There are thick black seaweed growing in it's mouth, like a door. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Inside it looks like the inside of a creatures throat. There are all manner of sea creatures around. The walls have barnacles, mussels, and other things growing on it. The floor is covered in dead white coral with black coral polyps (spot check, exceptional success to notice humanoid faces) and albino crabs. Past this leads to a chamber with several tunnels leading into darkness &lt;Picture Ursula's Grotto&gt;</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">This creature would stand at 5'2 it it had leg, but instead has a lower torso consisting of 8 long tentacles with </span></span><i><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">suction cups</span></span></span></i><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">on the inside. They are a emerald green on the outside, and light green on this inside. It's skin is light green gray in color. She has wavy blond hair going a little past her shoulders. It's slightly green in color. Her face is youthful and eerily beautiful. She has soft features, except for pointed pronounced cheekbones and her eyes are a solid black. Her face resembles a cross between Amanda Seyfried and Maleficent. Her hands end in long pointed slightly webbed claws. (She had fangs) She is wearing a dress made of purple scales and black pearls with gold strings. The scales shimmer shades of green when the light catches them. Has 2 moray eels swimming around her. (Flotsam and Jetsam)</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: part Shakespearean actress, with all the flair, flamboyance and theatricality, and part used-car salesman with a touch of con a