ere is a small black and white TV suspended by ropes in the right corner as soon as you enter the room. It's playing static, and occasionally scenes of the hedge, but very distorted. There is a single wooden door with frosted glass in the middle of the back wall. Inside resembles a medieval torture chamber, with many adjustable wooden wrack tables. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">There are usually 1-3 of these creatures around at any given time. They stand around 5 foot 10 and have smooth chalky off white grayish skin. They are have a single wine red cloth warped around where it's eyes would be. they has no visible noises. The hey red wine colored lips, and their mouths have no teeth or tongue. The tops and bottoms of their mouths are flexible and a pinkish color The can press together even with the mouth open, and function like a tongue. They are wearing bone white </span></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">robes down to their calf. It does not cover the sides of the legs and has no sleeves. They have a layered red wine colored sash around their stomach. They are wearing habits with a squared off top and that covers the sides of the faces and down over their shoulders and would over their pecks. One side of the front of it overlaps the other. They are skinny, and have slender bony limbs and hands. Their figurines and toes end in hard points. They lack finger and toe nails. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Amoral, Use a lot of horrible healing things, [llubeworm, polyp of cleanssing], talk like snakes (ssss ffff), shit a keeping secrets, feminine speech, we promise many things, this will not hurt is our favorite, t-t-t-k-p, t-p-p-pk-p, you may laugh with us, k-k-kt-k [can walk/stand on walls]</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Services: They heal, harm, sell poisons, do body modifications, buy organs, rare body parts, werewolf pelts or paws, witches eyes, etc</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Nara-O (Spirit) #16</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: 3 Dark black wood walls against where the wall wound be, but there is a stone square archway. Behind the archway is what looks to be near infinite library of towering book shelves. There is a dark purple tarpaulin for a roof of the wooden frame. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">This creature looks like a wrath. Its consists of black tattered robes that touch the floor, and large sleeves and a large hood covering it's face. Its hands are skinny, and bony. Voice sounds like 2 people talking, and coming from lower than the head. Its face and limbs are covered in bandages, and its is devoid of gender. It never speaks louder than a child's whisper. (Hand mouths on hands with long pointed tongues) (Face consists of nothing but a void.) </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Mysterious, very cryptic. Monstrously knowledgeable, eidetic memory with the encyclopedic memory merit on crack and then turned up to 11. Is a powerful spirit of secret. Is the spirit of secrets know to only by one person. High rank spirit. If there is information about you, he probably knows it. Likes collecting school yearbooks.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Buys and sells information, specializes in information, and mainly secrets. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Curse 