hant appears as a tall man, wrapped in steel chains. Any visible skin arrears to be dull in color with some unnatural blue shade to it. Its skin is also heavily scared and covered in red tattoos. It has no viable mouth, covered by a veil of chains. It's eyes are yellow and glow slightly.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Telepathic, speaks in head whispers, like to make weapons that hurt people, pleased weapons cause pain in misery. Is a sadists </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Sells weapons, but not firearms, does sell bow and arrows</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Kaaa (Kanontsist\u00f3ntie\u2019s) #20</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: There is a series of dozens of barrels against the wall with a red cloth banner nailed into the wall over and behind them. There is yellow writing on it. <b>&quot;Hats! Hats! Hats!&quot;</b></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">There is a head resting on top of one of the barrels. She has light tan skin and angular features. She looks to be native, and to be a pretty young woman. She has long 3 foot black hair, and dark brown eyes. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Floating head, no neck. Can use hair like hands. Also uses mouth to pick things up. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Very energetic, floating around, really like hats, buying hats, selling hats</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Hats, headbands, helmets, head dresses, headscarves, hoods, ... Some tokens, magical, hedge spun, mostly mundane. Also masks. Has a full barrel of Halloween masks. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Giggles The Clown (Eric Stone) #21</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: A plastic fold out table against one wall with a man sitting in a wooden chair next to it. There is a cardboard box under the table full of colorful items. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">The man stands at 5'10 with an average build. He is wearing yellow and red striped onesie with large red shoes. The outfit had purple and teal sleeves with a fluffy wrists. He has 3 large red buttons on his front, and a small blue and red checkered vest and has a frilly white collar with blue trim. He has white gloves on and white face paint. He has a big red smile, red rubber noise on, and blue diamonds painted around his eyes, and large black curved exaggerated eyebrows in a u shape. He is wearing a bright red wig. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Very joyful, just a normal clown that got lost and went through a portal to the hedge. Some how survived. Goblins like eating his balloon animals. Lost a little of his mind, produces extra joy glamour, and some how immune to the negative effects of constantly being fed on. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Makes Balloon animals and sculptures. Pretty good at it. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Absolem (Abs Sa Lome) #22</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>The Portobello Launge (Drug den, and hookah shop)</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: There is a small shop in the wall, with a 3ft high door, 1'3ft wide with stain glass windows. There are 2 stain glass Windows the size of a sheet of paper. On the left side of the door, one above the other. (One on each floor). Inside it looks like a bohemian gypsy den. There is a small blue caterpillar inside smoking on a hookah. All the chairs are mushrooms of different sizes and colors. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">A large, 3 inch vivid blue caterpillar with dark blue stripes on his back. Has a monocle on his left eye. It's legs ends in 2 fingered &quot;hands&quot; with thumbs. Has a humanoid face with green eyes, and a large flat noise. Has white whiskers on it's chin, cheeks, and over it's eyebrows. Has a series of dark blue dot willed with yellow along it's side over it's arms. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Sounds like Alan Rickman, talks dry, and drawn out with lots of pauses. Keeps taking puffs, high, keeps forgetting what he talks about</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Sells drugs made from hedge plants. pills and mushrooms that make you change size (roll is 6-10 dice, depending on mushroom vs pills, each success increases or decreases 1 size category, for every 2 shift, +1/-1 strength bonus. Lasts 1 hour or a scene. Cloths do not change size. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Shrub-Goroth #23</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>Shrub-Goroth's Pawn Shop</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: There is a glass door with a metal frame against the brick wall with a large bay display window in it's right. There are several enticing items in the window. There is a black board above the sign with green neon lights spelling out, <b>Shub-Goroth's Pawn Shop.</b>There is a neon diamondshaped sign<i><b>, </b></i>and a red neon \u201c<b>Instant Cash</b><i><b>\u201d</b></i> sign in the bay window<i><b>. </b></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">InsideLooks like a mundane pawn shop, but is extra dimensional. outside back wall and half of right has a long glass case separating the front from the back, with 2 wooden flip up doors at different points to get to the other side [Middle back and left side]. There are 5 large shelves with items on them. When you walk around one, The shelves change, and there are new items in them. There are also various things placed around the shop like lawnmowers, a wooden Indian, a jet ski, and a gum ball and popcorn machine. This things stay there, while other things change and disappear. The front and back of the shop at the same, and you can't get loss... usually. [Sometimes the extra dimensions acts queer]. Also there is a door on the left side with a red curtain, (Adult items) and saloon style door behind the counter leading to the back of the shop. [Has a large open portal behind some cabinet doors behind the counter.]</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Creature Looks like a large man sized purple starfish with 6 long tentacle like limbs. Has a large eye with a red iris with a h shape pupil. Has some smaller short tentacles around its large eye lids, but not on it. It's skin in veiny, and underside looks like a snakes belly.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Very friendly, deals mainly in money, buys mundane items. Chatty. Tells jokes, but none of them make sense. They tend to amuse him.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;Ask what Shrub-Goroth can do for you!&quot;</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Everything you could find in a pawn shop, plus guns and fake IDs, no drugs or alcohol.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Karp and Wilbur #24</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Two Vendors on opposite sides on the alley. They are very antagonistic towards each other, throwing insults, objects, and keep trying to take business from each other. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Karp</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: Stand is several wooden layered cases with ice packed in them. There is various sea creatures packed in the ice at various levels of processing. There is a thick wood table with a wooden cutting board on it next to the case, with several sharp knives with wooden handles next to it. There is a filleting knife resting on the board. There is olive colored tarpaulin over the stand. Area smells like fish.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stands at about 5'10 and is a fish man. Has a white underbelly with dark blue scales. Smells like the sea. Wearing black rubbers, with stained off yellow rubber waders. Has a black wool long sleeve sweater on over a white long sleeve shirt. Head is that of a fish, the width of the shoulders. Arms more in the side of its body. Wearing white wool gloves. (Has webbed fingers)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Fishy, looks nervous, sexiest, hits on women, or effeminate men but has sex like a fish, (talk while tong wiggling around, with back sucking saliva, </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Sells things from the seas, lakes, and rivers in the hedge (Talking fish selling a wish for freedom (Lying)</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Fish is loaded with important nutrients, such as protein and vitamin D. Fish is also the world's best source of omega-3 fatty acids, which are incredibly important for your body and brain.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Wilbur</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: Stand is a series of metal pans in a wooden frame. There are various meats there in different cuts. There is a storage area with a door under the pans. The metal pans are cold to the touch. [There is a frostling, a 2 foot ice hob goblin in the box. Low intelligent. Wilbur feeds it scraps which it freezes to eat. It occasionally escapes, but always come home.] There is a simular cutting board table set up like <b>Karps</b>, but the knives have good wooden handles. There is also a large cleaver resting on the board. There are several sausages, jerked, and processed meats hanging from the stall. The stand has a tarpaulin that appears to be made from a tanned pig hide. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wilbur Stands at 6'2 and is pig man. Resembles a anthropomorphic pig, with straight legs, and hooves. Is very heavy set, and pink in color. Wearing just a black butchers apron. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Very suborn, has many signs about discounts, but those are the ones never valid, last week, can smell money, make pig noises, heavy handed </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Sells meats from the hedge, and processes meats like hedge bacon, sausage, and jerked meats.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Pork is a good alternative to beef, because it is lean as well as low in fat (and lower in calories). It also has a number of important nutrients such as B6, B12, thiamine, and riboflavin. Pork also contains high amounts of other nutrients such as iron, magnesium, potassium, zinc and protein.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: The Merchant #25</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><i>Got a selection of good things on sale stranger.</i></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: There are 3 black spots shadow spots on the wall of the goblin market. He will occasionally pop out of one, do some business, and recede back into the darkness. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Man, standing around 6 feet in height. Wearing a thick long black tattered trench coat with a black hood. Has a large dark brown backpack on. Has a purple scarf with a pattern of silver lines wrapped around his lower face and neck. (Just below the noise) He has red eyes that glow slightly in the dark. His skin is pale, and he has fingerless brown leather gloves on. He opens his trench coat to reveal weapons, guns, shrunken heads, a severed monkeys hands, chicken feet, some glass vials filled with liquids, deck of cards, a compass and many oddities. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Guy from RE4 Got a lot of nice things for sale... Stranger, Ha, ha, ha. I'll buy it at a high price!</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Tokens, magic items not of changeling origin, buys and sell things like names, bought the name of Annex.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: </b><b>Garo #26</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: Looks like a wooden store front with a wooden door with no windows. The shop looks poorly constructed, with many cracks in the wood to let light though. Inside are shelves of knick-knack and mostly small objects, all in glass cases, bottles, boxes, and containers, or wrapped in cloth with runes on them, or with an Ofuda on them. (All fetter). Back of the shop, behind the wooden counter has larger items, like haunted beds, and for example Elizabeth B\u00e1thory bathtub [Very powerful item, haunted with dozens of ghosts, and weakens the gauntlet around it by 2]</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">There is a bell attached to a chain. Folded sign next to it says please ring for service. (The bell can only be heard by ghosts) There is long wooden box up against the left wall, behing the counter. There are </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Garo is short, standing at 5 feet. He is barefoot, and wearing white tattered robes down past his knees. It comes up over where the neck would be, and cover the lower face. He has a blue sash around his waste with red patterns on it. He has a gold necklace on and a large purple shawl covering his head and arms. There is no face visible, only darkness under the shawl. There is a single red light coming from the middle of the darkness. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Has a dead body in the wooden box encase he needs a corpse to posses. (Dresses in blue jeans and a dark gray hoodie) </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: A little crazy, Heh heh heh...your name is Paula, isn't it. Heh heh he...don't be surprised. Death surrounds you like a grave. My shop is the only Ghost Shop in entire hedge... Heh heh hee!&quot; </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Ghosts, and items for dealing with, empowering them, weakening them, and, harming them</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: </b><b>La taza #27</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: Has a glass display case in an L shape. Behind it is the wall of the goblin marker, and a pair of white slatted swing door. Inside the case of many different chocolates. There is a dark and light brown tarpaulin over the display cases. Has a wavy pattern to it. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Looks to be a 6'0 tall man of Spanish decent, except he's made of chocolate. His hair is darker in color, and short and combed over to his right side, also solid chocolate. He is wearing a white chef jacket, black pants, and a white chef hat. His cloths also appear to be made out of chocolate, but more flexible. </span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Speaks in a sexy french/spanish fusing accent, very sexual to everyone, trys to feed people, or anything, sometime can't tell human looking things from human, such as a statue. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: magic chocolate, like chocolate seeds that grow into chocolate trees, living small chocolate people (They dislike being eaten and show fear), animate chocolate frogs, birds, also has exotic and odd or revolting flavors</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>Dealer: Mrs. Lovett #28</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Stand: There is a wooden storefront with 3 round wooden tables outside of it with 2 chairs each. The door is solid wood, dark in color. There is a large glass window, but it's dirty, and hard to see through. Inside are several square and rectangle tables with thick wooden chairs. There is a wooden counter with a woman behind it rolling dough. There is a door way behind her leading to a back room.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">She stands at 5'6 and has a thin, malnourished appearance, with yellow waxy skin. There are dark rings around her sunken eyes dark brown eyes. Her hair is shoulder length ish and stringy and scraggly auburn hair. She is wearing a wide neck dress cobbled together from other dresses. The top part is back lace, and brown cotton. The bottom does to her feet and is an off olive green with brown, red, and teal stains on it. She is wearing lace fingerless gloves. From back on, there appears to be a large zipper on her back, starting at where the neck meets the skull. [wits+composure to notice things crawling under skin, and long black feelers sticking out the zipper occasionally]</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">RP: Always singing, trys to keep people eating and staying in shop, occasionally crawling on walls and skittery when she thinks people aren't looking. you have to get a success on (wyrd+composure) to no sing instead of talking. Must roll each time speaking. If you get 5 total success, you overcome the effect. </span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Wares: Sells Comfort food, meat pies, pub food. Sometime contains meat from intelligent creature. Varying degrees of flavor from horrific, to grand.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6760,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","user":"nlw162","date":". 09-02-2016, 02:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","name":"nlw162","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-01T16:12:48-07:00","id":961955,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><b>Dealer: Gimble #29</b><br /> Stand: There is old red vintage barber chair with some of the plastic cover cracked and missing in pieces. There are various dark stains on it. The are various wooden boards up against the wall with large pieces of some sort of tanned hide with different tattoos on them. Some are moving around and appear to be talking to each other, but you can't hear anything. There is one of a devils face tattooed on a red piece of hide that appears to speak at customers. (I'd like to be on that ass. He's a horny devil after all). There is a book shelf next to the chair with several thick tomb looking books, and some small wooden boxes of tattoo supplies. There is a small wooden chest near the back wall. The creature doing the tattooing is sitting down on a cheep black computer chair (The ones without arms). He is tattooing a storm cloud with lightening bolts on the hand of a woman wearing Jeans and a hoodie that appears to be made out of black wood. She has completely white skin covered is frost and a think coat of ice that cracks as she moves. (Sharlet, elemental, second born, )<br /> <br /> He stands at 6'2 and had a large muscular build. He is dark greenish yellow in color with yellow eyes with flakes of green and brown in them. He has fierce eyebrows, and has a 5'clock shadow. He looks very stern. Has a wide mouth with 2 tusks protruding from his mouth from his lower jaw. Has a noticeable underbite. He has several piercings in each ear. He is shirtless and covered in tattoos and scars. with rings piercing his nipples. He has off white cloth bandages warped around his forearms and is wearing dark red leather pants with black leather boots. He has a thick belt with animal skins and hides hanging for it. He also has a small pair of small fairy wing on his back that look like stubby dragonfly wings. (The size you'd see in a hallow costume.)<br /> <br /> RP: Talks in a deep guttural voice, frowning, gruff, hate when people bring other peoples art for him to tattoo, but does it (Constant complaining), takes pride in his work, don't be a baby<br /> Wares: Does Tattoos, piercings, scarification, brands,<span style=\"color:#000000\"> implants (body mods), eat and lip plates, toung spliting, Ohaguro (Teeth blackening), teeth sharpening. These can be mundaine or magical in nature, being intelligent, capable of making notice rolls, providing armor/weapons abilities or bonues, merit abilities, or skill bonuses)</span><br /> <br /> <b>Dealer: Glinda the Good Witch (Awakened mage) #30</b><br /> AKA <span style=\"color:#000000\">Jenny Greenteeth, Real name: Jennifer Gardner</span><br /> Stand: There is a normal sized wooden dutch door. It's made of thick wood of high quality and is very ornately carved. It's painted a rich blue. There is a metal mail slot it in and a gold handle and gold key hold over it. There is a 3 by 3 glass window with stain glass.<br /> <br /> Inside the floor is red cobblestone. The walls are a similar stone to the rest of the goblin market ally. The door is almost flush with the left wall of the shop. Straight ahead after a few steps is a wooden stair case going to a small second level half the length of the shop. The second floor is not over the first one, and makes the whole room a little bigger. The second floor has a railing around it, and has a large 3 by 2 wooden shelf full of scrolls, books, small box's, vials and flasks. The right wall on the second floor ends in a bricked up archway with some frames sketches. (Various people and scenes done is charcoal and pencil) There is a small door to the right of the stairs (locked) and a double shelf to the right of it full of labeled glass <span style=\"color:#222222\">container</span> with cork in them. They are filled with various colored liquids of different viscosity (Potions). In the middle of the room there is a table made out of a barrel with a flat surface around it's mid point. There are many filled glass containers around it and on the top of the barrel. The wall with the exterior door on it has various sacks, chests and tables next to it. There is a black cat (<span style=\"color:#000000\">Pascha) lazily sitting on a table there. The right wall has a long table against it with some box's under it. On the table there is purple and gold cloth with many mundane looking items on it. A pair of glasses, a pen made of bone, a small black ball (Weighs 100 lbs), a single arrow with a tag on it, (Arrow of regret) among other items. There is also a tall mirror and a dark oak and gold pendulum clock. In the upper right corner of the room is a crescent shaped counter with a woman behind it. There are various items on the counter, and shelves behind her with potions and objects in them.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">The woman stands at 5 feet in height with a petite but curvy build. She is wearing a long black dress going down to her ankles. The sleeves go down to her wrist and are tight on her arms. The is a dark purple and </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Red-violet pattern going up the middle of her dress with golden stitching. She is wearing a dark purple double breasted corset around her waste the ends below her breasts. The corset has arm straps that go up over the shoulders and form a short collar on the back of the neck. The middle of the corset is black and the buttons are brass. The dress has a low squared off neck line but completely cover her chest revealing no cleavage. The neck line is lacy and frilly. The shoulder on the dress are round a puffy. She had a large wide brim tall point hat on with a purple sash around it with a large gold buckle. She has green skin and bright red lips. Her eyes are smokey and purple in color. She has pretty face and looks to be in her 30's. She has a black beauty mark under her left eyes, and one on her chin. Her hair is black and shoulder length. Her noise and chin are a little more pointy than most people. She has a cape on that goes down to her feet and is black on the back and green on the inside. She has several rings on, one large, silver and a black stone in it. Her fingernails are pointed and black.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">RP: </span>Awkward<span style=\"color:#000000\">, bad with names,\u201dWait, let me write this down\u201d, calls her wares \u201cmy pretties\u201d, has a bad case of the dropies, very nerdy about making items. Like making potions and imbued items. Got involved in a conflict many years ago, was against Easter and other mages. Gets Aloof when bringing up the past. (Was cursed by another and did a lot of cruel things) Very old, possibly an arch mage. Very powerful. Hiding in the hedge, been involved with the market since its inception.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Wares: Potions, tass, imbued items, some artifacts, mana imbued objects, mana bread. Has some tokens (Mainly <u>Gewgaws, and</u></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><u>Trifles)</u>, goblin fruit and other oddities.</span><br /> <br /> <b>Dealer: </b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>Lempo, and Dellaro </b></span><span style=\"color:#000000\">(Lempo is the top, Dellaro is the bottom) </span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><b>#31</b></span><br /> Stand: Looks like a classic flower cart. It's dark wood with 2 large metal wheels, and handles on the opposite side for pulling it. The cart has a red tarpaulin with a wavy style and white trip. The cart has 2 layers of odd flowers there. (Has fabric and brown paper wraps for flowers) (One flower is a Egg shaped bulb with a 3 large leafs with orange thorns, has a ring of cabbage like leafs around the bulb. There is slit along the top of the bulb)<br /> <br /> The woman stands at 5'10 and had an average build. It has long greenish yellow hair down to in's ankles. Her skin is a whitish purple and covered in bruises. Her skin has an odd look to it. Her skin is in strips and woven together like a wicker basket. You can see her dark green muscles and black bones through the spacing of the skin. Her eyes are larger than normal, and white, except for pinpoint pupils and red veins. Her face looks skeletal around her eyes and she has very sunken cheeps. Her teeth are black , long and resemble knitting needles. She has 3 rows of teeth. She is wearing a dress down past her feet and extends 2 feet away from her on the ground. It is composed of long red strips of red leather about an inch wide. There is some kind of black mesh under it. The strips are bound together every 6 inches. The dress has a wide neck line with the strips not being straight across, making a jagged look. Her arms are thinner than normal, and bony. She has an extra fingers on each hand, and black talons.<br /> <br /> Over the dress shes wearing a green dress with white flowers on it with pink centers. There is a pink attacked belt tied with a ribbon on it and the straps are pink. There are three white buttons on the front down the middle. Also wearing a wide brim wicker sun hat with a ping ribbon on it. There are star shapes cut out of the brim so it looks like there are stars on her.<br /> <br /> She has no legs. Her lower torso consists of a mass of long arms ending in hangs, or 1 thick fingered talons. There is also a another head in the mass. That of a Skinned dead deer head with solid black eyes, and flexible movable black antlers. The muscles is dark green. It's teeth are black, but otherwise normal. She can flip around so the upper \u201ctorso\u201d is under the dress, and the deer head and arms are sticking out the top.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">RP: Lempo is shy around attractive men, giggly, smiley, bouncy, excited by little things, nervous, sky,</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Dellaro is always twisting hands, twitchy, firm negotiator, sinister laugh woa woa woa, scary and creepy, Lempo and Dellaro only eat human bones, but generally trade from them, no big on harming people,</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Dellaro: open throat up wide when speaking</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Wares: Flowers from the hedge. Some seeds and flower bulbs, most are toxic, many are carnivorous, some are parasitic.</span></span><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://s38.photobucket.com/user/NLW162/media/Goblin%20Market%20Map.gif.html\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"http://i38.photobucket.com/albums/e145/NLW162/Goblin%20Market%20Map.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6760,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","user":"nlw162","date":". 09-02-2016, 10:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","name":"nlw162","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T06:45:13-07:00","id":962231,"title":"","content":"There is a tiny bit on Changeling in New York in Dark Eras in the werewolf section, you may wish to check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-02T07:37:10-07:00","id":962269,"title":"","content":"Cool, I'll have to check it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","name":"nlw162","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T16:05:58-07:00","id":963952,"title":"","content":"That section also has a Betrayal mechanic that could be applied to any game line, and fits Changeling very well, its not really werewolf specific.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-05T17:49:52-07:00","id":963993,"title":"","content":"This...is awesome...and---<i>stolen for my own games! Mwuahahaha!</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-06T17:58:38-07:00","id":964680,"title":"","content":"Yes... Stolen... Dance puppets dance! Glad you like it. Hope you get some good use out of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6760-nlw162","name":"nlw162","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}